  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This paella serves 4 and takes about 1 hour from start to finish, including 20 minutes of prep. Cook it in the widest pan you have so the rice spreads in a thin, even layer and develops a proper crust on the base."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not stir the rice once you have added the stock. Paella is not a risotto. Leave it alone and let the base catch slightly to form the coveted golden crust called socarrat. You will know it is ready when you hear a gentle crackling sound from the pan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
